config BR2_PACKAGE_UCODE_MOD_LVGL
	bool "ucode-mod-lvgl"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LVGL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_UCODE
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBUBOX
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
	help
	  LVGL bound to ucode, so the front-panel UI can be written in
	  ucode rather than in C. Builds one file, lv.so, which ucode
	  loads as the module lv.

	  Carries the widgets, the DRM display and the evdev pointer,
	  and no fonts or artwork: those are loaded at run time from
	  files the application ships.

	  https://github.com/blogic/ucode-mod-lvgl
